1
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,000
We're near the border. Don't shoot.

2
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,840
You think you can cross the border?

3
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,199
In your dreams.

4
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,240
Even if you make it across,

5
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:52,240
we will still bring you to justice.

6
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,080
Captain Sun,

7
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:56,800
if you just let me go,

8
00:02:57,719 --> 00:02:58,479
all this money,

9
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,800
you and your men can split it.

10
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,360
Don't talk to me about your dirty money.

11
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:05,000
Every single cent of yours

12
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:07,360
is stained with innocent blood and tears.

13
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:09,080
How many people, because of you,

14
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,719
have lost their families,

15
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,439
their careers, and even their lives?

16
00:03:14,759 --> 00:03:15,919
You can't blame me.

17
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,000
They were too greedy,

18
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,159
too stupid.

19
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:20,800
I just took their money

20
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,919
and redistributed it.

21
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,439
I did nothing wrong.

22
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,800
You've ruined so many lives,

23
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,919
and you show absolutely no remorse.

24
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:28,800
You don't deserve to be called human.

25
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,199
Do you still remember her?

26
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,680
It's Sun Yao.

27
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,280
It's a real pity.

28
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:43,000
She was so pitiful.

29
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:44,599
She committed suicide.

30
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,039
Suicide?

31
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:48,360
You clearly drove her to her death!

32
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,840
She provoked me first!

33
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,520
How is that my fault?

34
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,199
I didn't mess with her!

35
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,039
Shut the hell up!

36
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:56,560
Let me tell you something,

37
00:03:57,039 --> 00:03:58,159
those who break the law

38
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:00,599
will inevitably face justice.

39
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,719
Take him away!

40
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,600
Dad.

41
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:29,480
Got your favorite Hand-Shredded Chicken.

42
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:33,319
Officer Sun told me

43
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,839
that at the last minute,

44
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:37,079
you passed all the evidence

45
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,720
to the police through Li Wen.

46
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,000
By the way, Dad,

47
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:59,319
I gave our family property to the police.

48
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:01,959
Rest in peace.

49
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,800
Yao Yao.

50
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:35,040
I'm here.

51
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,680
Thanks for your hard work lately.

52
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,800
If it weren't for you,

53
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,399
this case wouldn't have closed so fast.

54
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,439
Your anti-fraud work keeps getting better.

55
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:54,079
And countless brave people like Yao Yao

56
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:57,040
paid with their families and lives

57
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,319
for these lessons.

58
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,759
That's why you cracked the case so fast.

59
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,120
What are your plans now?

60
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:10,199
I want to

61
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,560
be an Anti-Fraud Consultant

62
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,680
and use my experience to help more people.

63
00:06:16,879 --> 00:06:17,680
By the way,

64
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,519
the Municipal Anti-Fraud Center

65
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:22,800
wants you as a technical consultant.

66
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:23,839
Are you interested?

67
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,600
As long as Captain Sun gives the word,

68
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,519
I'm on call anytime.

69
00:06:30,879 --> 00:06:31,680
You brat.

70
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:04,560
Leaving so soon?

71
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,959
My flight is tomorrow afternoon.

72
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:12,879
I've rescheduled three times.

73
00:07:12,879 --> 00:07:13,879
If I don't leave now,

74
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,800
the school will expel me.

75
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,480
Let me see you off then.

76
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:21,959
No need.

77
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,959
I don't really like

78
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,079
saying goodbye.

79
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:34,759
You're reporting to the bureau tomorrow?

80
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,680
Yeah.

81
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,680
If you're abroad

82
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,920
and suddenly receive an anti-fraud text,

83
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,319
there's a good chance I sent it.

84
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,399
Gu Ting.

85
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,480
Seeing you achieve your dream,

86
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:03,279
I'm really happy for you.

87
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:06,839
Me too.

88
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,360
Thank you.

89
00:08:29,679 --> 00:08:30,759
It's time.

90
00:08:31,879 --> 00:08:33,159
I should go.

91
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,000
Goodbye.

92
00:08:43,279 --> 00:08:44,600
Safe travels.

93
00:09:30,559 --> 00:09:31,720
Forgive me.

94
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,440
I can't let you live in Sun Yao's shadow.

95
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,440
I'm hungry.

96
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:41,159
I'm so hungry.

97
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:44,000
I'm starving!

98
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:49,639
I'm so hungry. I'm starving!

99
00:11:08,919 --> 00:11:09,559
No way.

100
00:11:09,639 --> 00:11:10,960
What are you doing? What are you doing?

101
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,120
Let me have a few bites, I'm starving.

102
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,039
You... you...

103
00:11:13,559 --> 00:11:14,440
Take it easy.

104
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,320
What are you doing, buddy?

105
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,159
Where are you from, buddy?

106
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,279
I'm from Henan.

107
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,039
Where in Henan?

108
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:18,679
Yanshi.

109
00:11:18,679 --> 00:11:19,639
Where in Yanshi?

110
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,240
Zhaizhen.

111
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,200
Where in Zhaizhen?

112
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,039
Dongwa.

113
00:11:22,039 --> 00:11:23,240
I'm from Dongwa too, buddy!

114
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:24,519
Let me have some.

115
00:11:24,519 --> 00:11:25,360
I'm starving too.

116
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,120
You're from Dongwa too?

117
00:11:26,559 --> 00:11:27,639
Countryman!

118
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,279
Take it easy.

119
00:11:29,279 --> 00:11:30,159
Here, here, here, here.

120
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,879
Don't rush.

121
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:40,320
Take it easy.

122
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:41,679
I'm hungry, buddy.

123
00:11:45,679 --> 00:11:46,759
Take it easy.

124
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:58,200
This is really good.

125
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,120
Give me another bite, buddy.

126
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:16,720
What happened to you, buddy?

127
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,279
Don't even ask, buddy.

128
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,080
A while back,

129
00:12:21,559 --> 00:12:22,720
I followed this boss.

130
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:24,679
The boss wore a gold chain.

131
00:12:24,679 --> 00:12:26,080
It looked so awesome to me.

132
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,879
My dream was to wear a gold chain

133
00:12:27,879 --> 00:12:29,679
and become a boss myself.

134
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,200
I just took one look,

135
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:43,720
and he kicked me.

136
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,679
Beat me black and blue.

137
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:51,480
Threw me in a well for two days.

138
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,960
I barely crawled out, buddy.

139
00:13:01,159 --> 00:13:02,600
What happened to you?

140
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,159
Ugh, don't ask.

141
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,080
Same as you.

142
00:13:08,159 --> 00:13:09,440
I followed a boss,

143
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:13,519
but the guy was totally evil.

144
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,240
I...

145
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,320
saw how badly that guy was beaten.

146
00:13:20,039 --> 00:13:21,480
I really couldn't stand it.

147
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,559
I hit him twice with a stick.

148
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:28,080
"You hit me?"

149
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:29,559
"Are you crazy?"

150
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:30,360
"He's already in such bad shape,"

151
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:31,840
"and you're still hitting him?"

152
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,200
"You're the one I'm beating!"

153
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:34,600
"You think you're so tough?"

154
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:43,360
He knocked me out with a stun baton.

155
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:46,840
Then I don't know what happened,

156
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,039
he stripped off my clothes,

157
00:13:49,039 --> 00:13:50,679
and threw me in a dog pen.

158
00:13:57,159 --> 00:13:58,480
It pisses me off just thinking about it.

159
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:02,799
That guy was too evil.

160
00:14:04,159 --> 00:14:05,879
He deserved it. You went too easy on him.

161
00:14:08,759 --> 00:14:09,759
If it were me, I'd have hit him too.

162
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,240
I think

163
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,360
it's tough surviving around here.

164
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,200
We'd better

165
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,360
go back to Dongwa. It's better for us.

166
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,480
I think so too.

167
00:14:24,679 --> 00:14:26,480
The city is full of tricks.

168
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,720
Screw it, let's go back to Dongwa, buddy.

169
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,519
Let's go.

170
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,720
Back to Dongwa to drink and eat meat!

171
00:14:32,799 --> 00:14:34,200
Let's go, buddy.

172
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:45,919
We're going home!
